  40:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  * @brief A Frame Oriented transmission protocol
  41:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  *
  42:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  * This protocol is designed to transport the messages of the Motor Control Protocol
  43:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  * across physical links such as UARTs.
  44:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  *
  45:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  * The Frame Communication Protocol component serves as a base to actual implementations
  46:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  * of the protocol that operate on specific physical links. So far, the only provided implementatio
  47:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  * of the protocol uses the USARTs as the physical link.
  48:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  *
  49:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  * @todo Complete documentation
  50:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/UILibrary/frame_communication_protocol.c ****  * @{
